  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nMode = 133 2/11 = 1465 ÷ 11\n\nClass interval = 5\n\nModal class = 130 − 135\n\nl = 130\n\nf₁ = 14\n\nf₀ = 7\n\nf₂ = X\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nMode = l + [(f₁ − f₀) ÷ (2f₁ − f₀ − f₂)] × h\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 1465 ÷ 11 = 130 + [(14 − 7) ÷ (2×14 − 7 − X)] × 5\n\n⇒ 1465 ÷ 11 = 130 + [7 ÷ (28 − 7 − X)] × 5\n\n⇒ 1465 ÷ 11 = 130 + [7 ÷ (21 − X)] × 5\n\n⇒ 1465 ÷ 11 − 130 = (35 ÷ (21 − X))\n\n⇒ (1465 − 1430) ÷ 11 = 35 ÷ (21 − X)\n\n⇒ 35 ÷ 11 = 35 ÷ (21 − X)\n\n⇒ 21 − X = 11\n\n⇒ X = 10\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 10.**\n\n15e:T61c,\n<",
